#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:3
#: c354cb9178244a22a1d4f2834872e084
msgid "自旋无序（Spin Disorder）"
msgstr "Spin Disorder"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:5
#: 03a733f1fcac4b5089549eb3c77aa2bb
msgid "**分类：** 磁性"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:7
#: f209fbdd7dcf42f8b2153762a37f0a5a
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:9
#: 14d8ccff8a074dd782f3bd4f61043940
msgid ""
"`Spin Disorder` 从已有磁矩或元素磁矩表出发，按指定无序比例生成中间磁态。它覆"
"盖 FM/AFM 到 PM 之间的离散翻转、随机方向和 cone disorder，不把这些离散无序混"
"进 `Magmom Rotation` 的连续小角扰动语义里。"
msgstr ""
"`Spin Disorder` starts from existing moments or an element map and generates "
"intermediate magnetic states at selected disorder fractions. It covers "
"discrete flips, randomized directions, and cone disorder between FM/AFM and "
"PM-like limits, keeping this discrete semantics separate from continuous "
"small-angle `Magmom Rotation`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:11
#: 409743c0d25d48529b4957e2dc56e0fa
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principle and equations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:13
#: b1b1c7344f6a43218f9f62a9a2c3621f
msgid ""
"设符合元素筛选且磁矩非零的原子数为 $N_m$，无序比例为 $f$。每个样本实际改动"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:15
#: 6ee27cee218c4fc1a05582e3d3929ca6
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_{\\mathrm{change}}=\\min\\!\\left(N_m,\\max\\left[1,\n"
"\\operatorname{round}(fN_m)\\right]\\right)\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:20
#: b9bec1a490f3446fae05a5848e23ac2c
msgid ""
"个不重复原子。`翻转一定比例`使用 $\\mathbf m_i'=-\\mathbf m_i$；`圆锥无序`在"
"原方向周围半角 $\\theta_{\\max}$ 的球冠上均匀抽样，其中 $\\cos\\theta\\sim "
"U(\\cos\\theta_{\\max},1)$；`随机化一定比例`在整个单位球面上抽取新方向。 三种"
"模式都保留被改动磁矩的模长，只改变方向。固定随机种子后，结构编号、比例和样本"
"编号 共同派生每个输出的随机路径。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:27
#: ca9a03b2f1a4483a82c355c36ffdd69e
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:29
#: 0a44dee18e8d478787c523b09d9d0c76
msgid "场景：模型只见过 FM/AFM 和完全随机 PM"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: The model sees only FM/AFM and fully random PM-like endpoints"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:31
#: 814ee349cbc14102a80ca3ad51863d7c
msgid ""
"FeCo 训练集包含 FM、AFM 和完全随机 PM，但缺少 10%-70% 局部翻转的中间无序态。"
"模型在有限温度磁态上能量排序不稳定。"
msgstr ""
"An FeCo set includes FM, AFM, and fully random PM-like states but lacks "
"intermediate states with 10-70% local flips, leading to unstable finite-"
"temperature energy ordering."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:33
#: 74423a60027c447497e7f7e33dfcafd9
msgid ""
"**输入：** 已经通过 `Magnetic Order` 或 `Set Magnetic Moments` 写入磁矩的结"
"构。 **目标：** 生成 `0.1,0.3,0.5,0.7` 四档局部翻转，让训练集覆盖有序到无序的"
"连续路径。 **参数设置：** `无序方式`选择“翻转一定比例”，`无序比例`填 "
"`0.1,0.3,0.5,0.7`，`每个比例的样本数`填 `3`，并开启`使用随机种子`。 **输出："
"** 每个输入结构生成 12 个自旋无序结构。 **怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 重训后，"
"中间翻转比例测试集的能量/磁力误差应不再显著高于 FM/AFM 端点。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:40
#: 6ee0b3a905d344a69ccebe8db0338ed2
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:42
#: f66dcc31a2fb45079a8e821a8243ba5c
msgid "无序模型"
msgstr "Disorder model"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:44
#: d9353e43c038464193deb66824e74e0d
msgid "模式（mode）"
msgstr "mode"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:46
#: 45796852a78d409b97212f6593fc8857
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Flip fraction'`。`Flip fraction` 保持共线轴只翻转符号，适合 FM/"
"AFM 到 PM 的离散无序梯度；`Randomize fraction` 把选中自旋方向在完整球面上随机"
"化；`Cone disorder` 保持围绕参考方向的有限温非共线扰动。这三个值与下拉框和序"
"列化参数完全一致。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:48
#: 27a64dbff8e846eea3910ca768c3b21b
msgid "比例（fractions）"
msgstr "fractions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:50
#: df4f2b79cf0846e4a5d077d78baacf22
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'0.1,0.3,0.5,0.7'`。被翻转或随机化的自旋比例，必须是逗号分隔且位"
"于 `(0, 1]` 的有限数值；非法文本和超范围值会明确报错，不会被忽略或截断。"
"0.1/0.3/0.5/0.7 可覆盖 FM/AFM 到 PM 之间的无序梯度。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:52
#: 7980882ebe1848068d797c4393be1a30
msgid "每个无序比例的样本数（samples_per_fraction）"
msgstr "samples_per_fraction"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:54
#: 314b8daff1de467d8762a8ac98a82336
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 `1`。同一无序度下不同随机选择会给不同局域环境。1 个用于路径扫描，"
"3-10 个用于统计训练。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `1`. Independent site selections per fraction. One traces a "
"path; 3-10 sample local variability."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:56
#: a8d50dae792f4ccba799f47b745ce5a5
msgid "锥角（cone_angle）"
msgstr "cone_angle"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:58
#: dd3c029da92647379604eec69439cad0
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 `30.0`。Cone disorder 中限制随机方向偏离参考轴的最大角。10-30° "
"表示有序态附近有限温扰动；接近 90° 时已接近强无序。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `30.0` degrees. Maximum cone deviation. About 10-30 degrees "
"stays near order; values approaching 90 degrees represent strong disorder."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:60
#: b80abc0da07c49519e1b9009311df3f3
msgid "生效条件：`模式`（`mode`）或方向模型选择 cone/noncollinear 随机化时。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:62
#: 404c20b6abbe4d909ecf8c4551beb0ea
msgid "磁矩幅值"
msgstr "Moment magnitudes"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:64
#: 87abc1fee5a34976bf772a2a9606d716
msgid "磁矩大小来源（magnitude_source）"
msgstr "magnitude_source"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:66
#: d7f190788bd94251943b182bd981226c
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Existing initial magmoms'`。输入有 `spin:R:3` 时优先复用；没有 "
"`spin` 时兼容旧 `initial_magmoms`。两者都没有时用 `元素磁矩表`"
"（`magmom_map`）/`默认磁矩`（`default_moment`）构造幅值。不要用默认幅值替代已"
"知元素磁矩。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:68
#: 444a164cef7e45b5988ff783897aed3f
msgid "元素磁矩表（magmom_map）"
msgstr "magmom_map"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:70
#: 1aea961ad723403cb2aa3f97334947a3
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `''`。已知元素局域磁矩时显式写入，如 `Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6`。未知元素不"
"要用默认值伪造先验。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `''`. Provide known element-resolved local moments "
"explicitly, for example `Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6`. Do not invent a prior for an "
"unknown element through a default value."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:72
#: 0f11b525816745b9b7779c9b6eddfcbd
msgid "默认磁矩（default_moment）"
msgstr "default_moment"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:74
#: 628da11990c647e4add6a9d61abf0573
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 `0.0`。只作为 `元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`）未命中元素的兜底幅"
"值。关键磁性元素应显式列出，非磁元素通常保持 0。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:76
#: a93608f806cb4684bc0eb3ad64d09194
msgid "标量磁矩转为矢量（lift_scalar）"
msgstr "lift_scalar"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:78
#: e32bfadf4dfc40a3a31bb956f7134897
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `True`。输入是标量磁矩但下游需要非共线向量时打开；如果原始数据已"
"有方向信息，不要重新提升覆盖它。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `True`. Enable when scalar moments must be promoted to "
"noncollinear vectors. Do not promote again when the input already contains "
"directional information."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:80
#: 78bae9d22d4242678c6af5902c11e459
msgid "轴（axis）"
msgstr "axis"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:82
#: 2825490a1aee4ec0b395cc06da1d5b11
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`。这是方向"
"参考，不是普通数值——改它会改变分层、表面法向或磁矩方向。使用前先确认 cell 取"
"向和目标物理方向。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`. This "
"is a directional reference, not an ordinary scalar setting: changing it "
"changes a layering direction, surface normal, or moment direction. Confirm "
"the cell orientation and intended physical direction first."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:84
#: 63b717e06f7c40158dde4d3218fa0295
msgid "生效条件：涉及方向、分层、表面或向量初始化的模式都会使用。"
msgstr ""
"Used by modes that depend on a direction, layering, a surface, or vector "
"initialization."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:86
#: a030ef90fa554760b4ad7c16e097ef09
msgid "应用元素（apply_elements）"
msgstr "apply_elements"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:88
#: 85bea8e885234f06b5df50e99b253234
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `''`。只对列出的磁性元素翻转或随机化。合金/界面里应显式列出磁性元"
"素，避免给非磁原子写入无意义磁矩。留空则全部参与。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `''`. Limit processing to listed magnetic elements. "
"Explicitly list them in alloys or interfaces to avoid assigning moments to a "
"nonmagnetic host. Empty means all eligible atoms."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:90
#: 7e7e618d606348129be0de5c0c8046d9
msgid "随机性和预算"
msgstr "Randomness and output budget"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:92
#: 1f50cb5f03394eb3938cfca8dab7047c
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "use_seed"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:94
#: fc410c326e584dd6b41d8d561e070590
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `False`。勾选后固定种子可复现。对比实验时开，最终大规模随机探索"
"可以关——但关后结果不能逐帧复现。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `False`. Enable to reproduce with a fixed seed. It may be "
"disabled for large exploration, but individual outputs then cannot be "
"reproduced."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:96
#: 0cb015e683b041c1a96b4539583956ad
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "seed"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:98
#: 9c6f4bfc939f4956876f232e84173e1c
msgid "`int`，默认 `0`。同一输入、同一参数和同一 seed 应生成同一批候选。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `0`. Identical input, parameters, and seed produce the same "
"candidates."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:100
#: f4f8d9ffcbf841bc964bbdaf25c5a4af
msgid "生效条件：`use_seed=True`。"
msgstr "Active only when `use_seed=True`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:102
#: a15ff305bdc64e4da867895ddd3d1c29
msgid "最大输出数（max_outputs）"
msgstr "max_outputs"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:104
#: 6ec62d14b6934bd7bd336b7cd8a5b065
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 `100`。总输出约等于 fractions 数量乘以 samples_per_fraction。链式"
"输入多时必须设上限，避免磁无序样本淹没结构样本。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `100`. Output is approximately number of fractions times "
"samples per fraction. Keep a cap when many upstream frames could let "
"magnetic variants overwhelm structural diversity."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:106
#: 0d3ca1dc3cc2405092d820b9b3374433
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:108
#: 78e876c6cb0545a5bf4d6d1d4fac3a56
msgid "共线翻转梯度"
msgstr "Collinear flip-fraction path"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:110
#: 69d0797836d54b64b0265deb0fa913af
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"SpinDisorderCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"mode\": \"Flip fraction\",\n"
"    \"fractions\": \"0.1,0.3,0.5,0.7\",\n"
"    \"samples_per_fraction\": 3,\n"
"    \"cone_angle\": 30.0,\n"
"    \"magnitude_source\": \"Existing initial magmoms\",\n"
"    \"magmom_map\": \"\",\n"
"    \"default_moment\": 0.0,\n"
"    \"lift_scalar\": true,\n"
"    \"axis\": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0],\n"
"    \"apply_elements\": \"\",\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42,\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 100\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:131
#: 9677a3d526084e359d5fcf8cc7f91855
msgid "用于从 FM/AFM 参考态生成局部翻转比例扫描。"
msgstr "Scan local flip fractions from an FM or AFM reference."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:133
#: 326b30266b0d4114bd488a6f5722bd50
msgid "非共线 cone disorder"
msgstr "Noncollinear cone disorder"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:135
#: bd0891138f6c487b891e8dabe69f41a0
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"SpinDisorderCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"mode\": \"Cone disorder\",\n"
"    \"fractions\": \"0.25,0.5,0.75\",\n"
"    \"samples_per_fraction\": 2,\n"
"    \"cone_angle\": 20.0,\n"
"    \"magnitude_source\": \"Existing initial magmoms\",\n"
"    \"magmom_map\": \"\",\n"
"    \"default_moment\": 0.0,\n"
"    \"lift_scalar\": true,\n"
"    \"axis\": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0],\n"
"    \"apply_elements\": \"Fe,Co\",\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 7,\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 50\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:156
#: 4a2592118ad846b48c07b0d42edc6154
msgid "用于有限温度附近的非共线方向扰动。"
msgstr ""
"Add noncollinear directional fluctuations near an ordered finite-temperature "
"state."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:158
#: ab7aad52631d41d78c6005b625100627
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:160
#: 9ea19af6596b411b963137eab09bc4d4
msgid ""
"`Magnetic Order → Spin Disorder`：先建立 FM/AFM 参考态，再生成中间无序比例。"
msgstr ""
"`Magnetic Order` -> `Spin Disorder`: establish an FM/AFM reference, then "
"generate intermediate disorder fractions."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:161
#: c63bad995af74707a47caedbcd8ceb0f
msgid ""
"`Set Magnetic Moments → Spin Disorder → Small-Angle Spin Tilt`：先统一磁矩模"
"长，再做无序化和小角偏转。"
msgstr ""
"`Set Magnetic Moments` -> `Spin Disorder` -> `Small-Angle Spin Tilt`: define "
"magnitudes, apply discrete disorder, then add small angular deviations."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:162
#: 631b7a116e5747348d57e6bc4e530693
msgid ""
"`Spin Disorder → Geometry Filter`：磁性结构如果同时经过强几何扰动，后面接几何"
"清洗。"
msgstr ""
"`Spin Disorder` -> `Geometry Filter`: clean geometry if magnetic variants "
"also underwent strong structural perturbation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:164
#: c9f8fff9c0d24b61bc3719ddccacc328
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:166
#: a34b3ecfdbe9466a955ffbcf544fcc25
msgid ""
"**运行报错：找不到 eligible magnetic moments。** 输入没有可用磁矩，或 `应用元"
"素`（`apply_elements`）没有匹配任何非零磁矩。先用 `Set Magnetic Moments` 或 "
"`Magnetic Order` 初始化。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:168
#: d05998961b40487baab72ab9b881abc3
msgid ""
"**翻转数量不是精确小数比例。** 原子数是离散的，程序按 fraction 转成整数个原"
"子，至少选 1 个且不超过 eligible atom 数。"
msgstr ""
"**The flipped count is not the exact decimal fraction.** Atom counts are "
"discrete; the fraction is converted to an integer between one and the "
"eligible count."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:170
#: c584dbafe2a746d49b04cc495426c0a7
msgid ""
"**`Cone disorder` 看起来和 PM 不一样。** cone disorder 只在参考方向附近随机，"
"不是全空间 PM。全空间随机用 `Randomize fraction`。"
msgstr ""
"**Cone disorder does not look PM-like.** It samples only near reference "
"directions. Use `Randomize fraction` for full-sphere randomness."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:172
#: 7fdd2eb9537240e0bdfd2b88a0ece48c
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:174
#: 0e20fbb645d046daabb0fef325daf21d
msgid ""
"`SpinDis(f={fraction},n={count},mode={flip|rand|"
"cone},s={seed},a={cone_angle})`。`s` 只在 `use_seed=True` 时出现，`a` 只在 "
"cone disorder 输出中出现。"
msgstr ""
"`SpinDis(f={fraction},n={count},mode={flip|rand|"
"cone},s={seed},a={cone_angle})`; `s` appears only with `use_seed=True`, and "
"`a` only for cone output."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:176
#: f8c02050d5314778b5cb1639a66defdf
msgid ""
"所有导出输出写入 `spin:R:3`；内部同步维护 ASE `initial_magmoms` 向量别名。"
msgstr ""
"All exported outputs use `spin:R:3`; an ASE vector-valued `initial_magmoms` "
"alias is kept in sync internally."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:178
#: b223c5ca4f814cf1b66c615e52c85db7
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:180
#: 4564d50e7f1b4df88660646e99821fe5
msgid ""
"开启 `使用随机种子`（`use_seed`）后，随机原子选择和方向采样由 `随机种子`"
"（`seed`）、输入结构标识、fraction 序号和 sample 序号共同决定。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输入：** 已经通过 `Magnetic Order` 或 `Set Magnetic Moments` 写入磁矩的"
#~ "结构。 **目标：** 生成 `0.1,0.3,0.5,0.7` 四档局部翻转，让训练集覆盖有序到"
#~ "无序的连续路径。 **参数设置：** `mode=Flip fraction`，"
#~ "`fractions=0.1,0.3,0.5,0.7`，`samples_per_fraction=3`，开启 `use_seed`。 "
#~ "**输出：** 每个输入结构生成 12 个自旋无序结构。 **怎么验证训练集质量改善："
#~ "** 重训后，中间翻转比例测试集的能量/磁力误差应不再显著高于 FM/AFM 端点。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Input:** Structures initialized by `Magnetic Order` or `Set Magnetic "
#~ "Moments`. **Objective:** Sample flip fractions `0.1,0.3,0.5,0.7`. "
#~ "**Parameters:** `mode=Flip fraction`, those four fractions, "
#~ "`samples_per_fraction=3`, and `use_seed` enabled. **Output:** Twelve "
#~ "states per input. **Verification:** After retraining, energy and magnetic-"
#~ "force errors at intermediate fractions should no longer greatly exceed "
#~ "endpoint errors."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `'Flip fraction'`。`Flip fraction` 保持共线轴只翻转符号，适合 "
#~ "FM/AFM 到 PM 的离散无序梯度；`Randomize fraction` 把选中自旋完全随机化；"
#~ "`Cone disorder` 保持围绕参考方向的有限温非共线扰动。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default `'Flip fraction'`. `Flip fraction` preserves the collinear "
#~ "axis and flips signs; `Randomize fraction` assigns fully random "
#~ "directions to selected spins; `Cone disorder` adds finite-temperature "
#~ "noncollinear deviations around references."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `'0.1,0.3,0.5,0.7'`。被翻转或随机化的自旋比例，从 0 到 1。"
#~ "0.1/0.3/0.5/0.7 可覆盖 FM/AFM 到 PM 之间的无序梯度。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default `'0.1,0.3,0.5,0.7'`. Fractions from 0 to 1 of spins to "
#~ "flip or randomize. The default spans an ordered-to-disordered path."

#~ msgid "生效条件：`mode` 或方向模型选择 cone/noncollinear 随机化时。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Used when the mode or direction model selects cone/noncollinear "
#~ "randomization."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `'Existing initial magmoms'`。输入有 `spin:R:3` 时优先复用；没"
#~ "有 `spin` 时兼容旧 `initial_magmoms`。两者都没有时用 `magmom_map`/"
#~ "`default_moment` 构造幅值。不要用默认幅值替代已知元素磁矩。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default `'Existing initial magmoms'`. Reuse `spin:R:3` when "
#~ "present and accept legacy `initial_magmoms` only when `spin` is absent. "
#~ "If neither exists, construct magnitudes from `magmom_map` and "
#~ "`default_moment`; never replace known element moments with a generic "
#~ "default."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 `0.0`。只作为 `magmom_map` 未命中元素的兜底幅值。关键磁性元"
#~ "素应显式列出，非磁元素通常保持 0。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `0.0`. Used only when an element is absent from "
#~ "`magmom_map`. List important magnetic elements explicitly; nonmagnetic "
#~ "elements should normally remain at 0."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**运行报错：找不到 eligible magnetic moments。** 输入没有可用磁矩，或 "
#~ "`apply_elements` 没有匹配任何非零磁矩。先用 `Set Magnetic Moments` 或 "
#~ "`Magnetic Order` 初始化。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**No eligible magnetic moments.** The input lacks usable moments or "
#~ "`apply_elements` matches none with nonzero magnitude. Initialize with "
#~ "`Set Magnetic Moments` or `Magnetic Order`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "开启 `use_seed` 后，随机原子选择和方向采样由 `seed`、输入结构标识、"
#~ "fraction 序号和 sample 序号共同决定。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "With `use_seed`, site selection and directions are determined by the "
#~ "seed, input identity, fraction index, and sample index."
